  "brain_first": "“先看空后是不是一个句子；再看这个句子缺不缺成分、与前面 什么关系。”",
  "sort_order": 1057,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2429
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "空连接两个成分或引导从句；可能是 and/but/",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2430
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "or，也可能是 who/which/that/what/when/",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2431
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "where/because/although 等。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2432
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2433
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "连接词选择同时取决于句子结构和语义关系。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2434
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先看空后是不是一个句子；再看这个句子缺不缺成分、与前面",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2435
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "什么关系。”",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2436
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这是无提示词最核心的判断。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2437
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2438
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看空后有没有主语+谓语。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2439
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 如果在修饰前面名词 → 考虑定语从句。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2440
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 如果整个从句在大句中当“一个东西” → 名词性从句。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2441
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 如果表示时间/原因/条件/让步等关系 → 状语从句。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2442
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 若只是连接两个并列成分 → and/but/or/so。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2443
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2444
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2445
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2446
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 定语从句：先看先行词，再看从句缺成分否",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2447
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 名词性从句：what在从句中充成分，that通常不充成分",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2448
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 状语从句：按语义关系选 because/if/although/when 等",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2449
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 结构和语义同时满足。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2450
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 看不出从句类型时先把从句用括号框起来，问它在大句中“修饰名词、当东",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2451
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "西、还是表示关系”。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2452
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2453
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The stands ___ sell dumplings were crowded. 修饰stands，从句缺主语 → that/which。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2454
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2455
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看见地点名词就选where。",
      "sourcePage": 88,
      "sourceIndex": 2456
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· what/that只按中文翻译选。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2457
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2458
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 空后句子完整吗？",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2459
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 修饰谁/当什么/表示什么关系？",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2460
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2461
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2462
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2463
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 无词连句：先结构，后关系。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2464
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2466
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. city ___ I visited：which还是where？",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2467
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. city ___ I lived：",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2468
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. I know ___ he needs：",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2469
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. I know ___ he is right：",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2470
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. although连接的关系？",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2471
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. which/that，visited缺宾语。；2. where，lived结构完整，需地点状语。；3. what，needs缺宾",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2472
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "语。；4. that，从句完整。；5. 让步。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2473
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF9 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF9”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2474
    }
  ],
